<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1TH" style="id">Bugun: Bible Translation 1st Edition</book>
  <para style="ide">Unicode (UTF8)</para>
  <para style="h">1 Thesalonithek</para>
  <para style="toc1">THESALONITHEK shii Phaul re-è Igobi pha Jigigam</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Thesalonithek</para>
  <para style="toc3">1The</para>
  <para style="mt1">THESALONITHEK</para>
  <para style="mt2">Shii Phaul Re-è Igobi Pha Jigigam</para>
  <para style="imt">Yaophi</para>
  <para style="ip">Thesalonikha ne Mesidonia du-ùa Roman Rajan pha Jila ro. Philiphi thoh muii pha iidoh shii Phaul è thiichiih shii Charch rung. Hanyie yi Jewthek ro giang shii rey yang pho pha Jewthek asi pha duchoi shii Phaul ro Migipho pha mua yua pha ji ne blia wie re pha ji shii Jewthek ne khthiie miegriie dun ro gak. Phaul shii Thesalonikha thoh ne Berea hà dun dun bangchiie rek. Chiihphado, ai Khorinth hà thog, Phaul yi awai ijak nane bliapho ijak Thimothi è Thesalonikha charch pha phosro yaophi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Phaul ro igobi pha jigigam yi Thesalonikhapho shii lububo rekpha nane thiisa pha Masipho shii chuh rek phi. Ai è ithek ro migi nane miie pha mua chiang shii laso phi; ai ithek rog rai shii awai murai pha chai ichua ji ithek shii now yi, chiih-è chiihphado charch hà Masi ne wuii din ruii pha musai ji ithek shii changphi: Masi iidoh awuii ba pha ibi shii migipho iy arone ai iidoh wuii shii yi pha idang pha chai shii thang mua habey? Chiih-è Masi ne khuchung wuii ruii phalei? Ji pha ishak shii Phaul è Masi iidoh wuii ruii pha luthong ramuii pha ji shii ne liijiing è blia rek bo è yua pha chua yie.</para>
  <para style="iot">Iliing shii um pha ji</para>
  <para style="io1">Yaophi <char style="ior">(<ref loc="1TH 1:1">1:1</ref>) </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Laso nane chiong <char style="ior">(<ref loc="1TH 1:2-3:13">1:2—3:13</ref>) </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Migipho ro ziig shii lububo rek phi <char style="ior">(<ref loc="1TH 4:1-12">4:1-12</ref>) </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Masi wuii ruii pha chiang shii yao <char style="ior">(<ref loc="1TH 4:13-5:11">4:13—5:11</ref>) </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Idohhè pha lububo rek phi pha ji <char style="ior">(<ref loc="1TH 5:12-22">5:12-22</ref>) </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Jongsha <char style="ior">(<ref loc="1TH 5:23-28">5:23-28</ref>) </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TH 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 1:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 17:1">Blk 17:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Phaul, Silas, nane Thimothi è,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TH 1:1">Thesalonikha charch pha bran shii, hanyie yi Aphuii Hamangkhung-aphuii nane Ithong Isu masi ro:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TH 1:1">Khirzey nane liijiing ne nathek ro ro.<verse eid="1TH 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="s">Thesalonithek pha chai nane migi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 1:2"/>Gathek ne nathek zab chiang Hamangkhung-aphuii shii idang laso phi chiih-è nathek shii idang gathek misia shii sia phi <verse eid="1TH 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 1:3"/>Nyie khi-èrek ne migi shii blia hà rek yi, chiih-è nathek ro miie ne khi-èrek ne nathek ro blia shii snak rek, chiih-è gathek ro Ithong Isu Masi shii nathek ro luthong ne khi-èrek ne chuh rey yi pha ji gathek ro Hamangkhung-aphuii nane Aphuii shii ibi now ro. <verse eid="1TH 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 1:4"/>Gathek khuiinothek nane bumuiithek, gathek ne thieg Hamangkhung-aphuii ne nathek shii miie chiih-è awairo rey yi pha guajong ro. <verse eid="1TH 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 1:5"/>Gathek è Mua Wie ne miyaogamthek asi bie pha, jimagunde blu nane Ragung So rog shii ro, chiih-è zab pha izai rog shii nathek shii yie phi ro. Gathek ne nathek rog shii rai shii khi-èrek pha ji ne nathek de thieg; hì ne nawaithek shii wie pha ji um ro. <verse eid="1TH 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 1:6"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 17:5-9">Blk 17:5-9</ref></char></note> Nathek ne gathek shii nane Ithong shii nui ro, chiih-è nathek shii bajo diigchiao rek magunde, nathek ne Ragung So è thog pha mua shii lubo rog shii choi ro. <verse eid="1TH 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 1:7"/>Nathek ne Mesidonia nane Akhaya pha zab migiphothek shii miiriig redun ro. <verse eid="1TH 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 1:8"/>Chiih-è Ithong ro mua chiang ne nathek è fuang Mesidonia nane Akhaya hà rek bie pha asi pha, Jimagunde naro migi ne Hamangkhung-aphuii shii um rone zab hà thogdun ro. Chiihphado, nyie oisha, gathek ne yao chid. <verse eid="1TH 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 1:9"/>Gathek yi nathek shii wuii shii nathek è gathek shii khi-èrek ne choi, chiih-è nathek è khi-èrek ne Hamangkhung-aphuii shii khid ne, izai isieng shii blia rek ne <verse eid="1TH 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 1:10"/>chiih-è Dufuii hamangkhung è wuii ruii pha ji shii khan—ai Dufuii Isu, hanyie è iy pha ji è hòi phi chiih-è Hamangkhung-aphuii ro lijieg thog ruii pha ji shii Isu è ragia rek phi pha ji shii branthek zab ne nathek chiang yao muii ro.<verse eid="1TH 1:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TH 2"/>
  <para style="s">Phaul Thesalonikha shii blia rek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 2:1"/>Gathek ro khuiinothek nane bumuiithek, nathek nawaithek de thieg gathek è nathek shii wuii pha ji ne adubo asi ro.<verse eid="1TH 2:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 2:2"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 16:19-24">Blk 16:19-24</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 17:1-9">Blk 17:1-9</ref></char>
    </note> Nathek ne thieg gathek ne Thesalonikha hà nathek shii awuii ba shii Philiphi hà gathek shii ne makhak-riing ne diigchiao reyjong ro. Chiih-è thiisa hàne bajo suang ne muna um magunde, gathek ro Hamangkhung-aphuii ai è thog pha Mua Wie ji nathek shii yua yi gathek shii lububo phi. <verse eid="1TH 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 2:3"/>Gathek è nathek shii khung pha ji ne buii, dinne izea nowthek è arek ro, chiih-è hanyie jia shii khinrin pha abidiang ro. <verse eid="1TH 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 2:4"/>Ji pha chiang, gathek ne idang Hamangkhung-aphuii è chid pha ji yao ro, Nyieliieshii Mua Wie ji phi spho rone ai è gethek shii chuajong ro. Gathek ne bran shii nyu yi pha asi ro, jishii hanyie è gethek ro now pha ji shii chai pha Hamangkhung-aphuii shii nyu yi pha rek ro, <verse eid="1TH 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 2:5"/>Nathek bajo wie è thieg, gathek ne nathek shii shan ne yao pha awuii ro, chiih-è sgoh shii ug pha miyaogamthek akho ro—Jithek zab shii ne Hamangkhung-aphuii ne gathek ro khagi ro! <verse eid="1TH 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 2:6"/>Gathek ne hanyie è de chiong yi pha abidiang ro, jimagunde na è de dinne gai è de asi ro, <verse eid="1TH 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 2:7"/>gathek ne Masi pha Guaphasamoythek pha ji è nathek shii nyanak spho shii ro. Jishii amuii<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:7: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">gethek khihà gai bran gethek khihà nathek rog, amuii duii ne</char><char style="ft" closed="false">giak jigizey shii um </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">gathek ne nathek rog shii ne ani duiine ro; gathek ne amuii duii ne ro.</char></note> è awai ani shii gayiig pha duiine gathek ne nathek rog um shii jum rek ne rai. <verse eid="1TH 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 2:8"/>Nyieliieshii gathek è nathek shii miie pha ji è gathek ne nathek shii Hamangkhung-aphuii ro Mua Wie ji asi bie pha gathek ne guithek ro chaithek shii de thang pha sarojong. Nathek ne gathek ro bajo miie ro! <verse eid="1TH 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 2:9"/>Zai nathek ne nowkhlei iwa, gathek ro khuiinothek nane bumuiithek, gathek è Hamangkhung-aphuii Mua Wie ji yua shii nathek shii nyie diig arey yi pha gathek ne inai nane habiu blia bajo diig rek!<verse eid="1TH 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 2:10"/>Nathek ne gathek ro khagi, nathek è migi rek pha ji ne gathek ne khi-èrek ne gang, rangsua, nane ichiig asi rone sieng pha ji ne Hamangkhung-aphuii awai de khagi ro. <verse eid="1TH 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 2:11"/>Nathek ne thieg gathek è nathek zab shii rek noh pha ji ne aphuii è awai aniphiing shii rek pha ji duiine rek noh. <verse eid="1TH 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 2:12"/>Gathek è nathek shii lububo rek phi, gathek è nathek shii liijiing phi, chiih-è gathek ne nathek shii khung hanyie è awairo Sajathua nane Biisiie shii thang yi pha nathek shii ho pha ji shii Hamangkhung-aphuii è sang pha chai ichua shii rai pha lububo rek phi ro.<verse eid="1TH 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 2:13"/>Chiih-è gathek ne Hamangkhung-aphuii shii idang laso phi pha gai chiang de um ro. Gathek è nathek shii Hamangkhung-aphuii pha mua yie phi shii, nathek ne nuii ne choi, jine branthek pha mua duiine asi pha jishii Hamangkhung-aphuii mua rone choi, hì ne izai ro. Nyieliieshii Hamangkhung-aphuii ne nathek è migi rekpho shii blia rek phi. <verse eid="1TH 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 2:14"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 17:5">Blk 17:5</ref></char></note> Gathek ro khuiinothek nane bumuiithek, Hamangkhung-aphuii ro charch Judea hà hanyie yi Masi Isu è rey pho shii Jewish è diig phi. Ji duiine nathek shii de nawaithek bran è diig mua ruii phro, <verse eid="1TH 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 2:15"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:23">Blk 9:23</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 9:29">29</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 13:45">13:45</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 13:50">50</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 14:2">14:2</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 14:5">5</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 14:19">19</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 17:5">17:5</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 17:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 18:12">18:12</ref></char></note>hanyie è Ithong Isu shii nane chaigthek shii ua muii, chiih-è gathek shii diigchiao phi. Hamangkhung-aphuii shii ne ithek ne khama asang yi phro! Ithek shii ne khama zab ro mak ro! <verse eid="1TH 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 2:16"/>Ithek ne mua è giawo yie pha gaibranthek shii yua pha ji shii rangde gathek shii gak pha bidiang. Ji duiine ithek è idang rek pha layogthek shii jongdang pha rek ro. Chiih-è thuh Hamangkhung-aphuii ro lijieg ne iidohè ithek shii thog ruii phro.<verse eid="1TH 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Phaul è ithek shii wuii pha yang din</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 2:17"/>Gathek ro, khuiinothek nane bumuiithek, gathek yi nathek è ìujia yoh rey mage shii—izai gathek munow ji-è yoh asi ro, jishii siu è bie—gathek ne nathek shii khama now ne khama gathek ne nathek shii si din pha snak bidiang! <verse eid="1TH 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 2:18"/>Gathek ne nathek shii khid pha yang. Gu ne dinne luang jia iidoh wuii pha bidiang, jimagunde sakhathong è gathek shii awuii yi.<verse eid="1TH 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 2:19"/>Zab, nathek ro hanyie gathek ro luthong ne, gathek ro lubo ro, chiih-è gathek ro Ithong Isu wuii ruii mage shii ai mieg moe shii gathek è yang shii nyigodog rek pha chiang ne nathek ro chiih-è nathek ne gai è ìu asi ro. <verse eid="1TH 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 2:20"/>Zai, nathek gathek ro wiangwe nane gathek ro lubo ro!<verse eid="1TH 2:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TH 3"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 3:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 17:15">Blk 17:15</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Idohhè, gathek ne hì shii azud mua ro. Ji-è gathek ne Athens jia hà rai pha phak, <verse eid="1TH 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 3:2"/>gethek ro khuiinothek hanyie gathek rog shii Hamangkhung-aphuii ro blia Masi chiang Mua Wie yao pha gathek ne Thimothi shii ren ge. Nathek shii chuh rek ne migi shii nong phi pha gathek è aishii thoh gey, <verse eid="1TH 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 3:3"/>ji-è nathek ne jia de ji pha diigcheothek pha chiang è iidoh akhid yi. Nawaithek ne thieg hìthek zab pha diigcheothek ne Hamangkhung-aphuii è gethek shii yang pha ji ro. <verse eid="1TH 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 3:4"/>Chiih-è gathek ne nathek rog ba shii, gathek ne nathek shii igobi mujo yaojong gethek ne diigchiao ruii phro; chiih-è nathek ne wie è thieg, jine ji duiine rey ro. <verse eid="1TH 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 3:5"/>Ji-è gu ne Thimothi shii thoh ge. Gu ne hì shii azud mua ro, ji-è gu ne nathek migi chiang thieg yi pha aishii thoh. Zai nathek shii ne Sakhathong è chuajan ne zab gathek blia ne adubo arey yi phro! <verse eid="1TH 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 3:6"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:5">Blk 18:5</ref></char></note> Thuh Thimothi ne iidoh dun thog, chiih-è ai è gathek shii nathek ro migi nane miie pha chiang shii wie pha mua yiethok. Ai è gathek shii yao nathek ne idang gathek shii wie now ne na è gathek shii riig yang pha ji duiine bajo gathek ne nathek shii riig yang muii ro. <verse eid="1TH 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 3:7"/>Ji-è khuiinothek nane bumuiithek zab gathek ro diig nane duhug ne gathek na chiang shii è lububo ro. Hì ne naro migi ji è gathek shii lububo rek phi, <verse eid="1TH 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 3:8"/>nyieliieshii thuh nathek ro chai ne Ithong rog ò nane chuh riu arone gathek ne zai sieng mua. <verse eid="1TH 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 3:9"/>Thuh gathek ne na chiang è Hamangkhung-aphuii shii laso nyaphi mua. Nyieliieshii na chiang è gathek ne ai moe gathek bajo lubo um ro ji-è gathek ne aishii laso phi. <verse eid="1TH 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 3:10"/>Chiih-è nathek shii riig wuii srane nathek ro migi shii nyie chid ne nyie phi mua pha ji shii aishii lia ne inai nane habiu gathek lubu shii sia ro. <verse eid="1TH 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 3:11"/>Gathek ro Hamangkhung-aphuii nane Aphuii awai nane gathek ro Ithong Isu è nathek shii wuii pha lumuii saro phi bo! <verse eid="1TH 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 3:12"/>Ithong è nawaithek chung pha miie shii rab ne nathek shii gathek ro miie khama boh duiine zab bran chiang miie shii muna nane muna sieng bo. <verse eid="1TH 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 3:13"/>Ji duiine aine nathek shii chuh rek ruii phro, chiih-è Ithong Isu yi hanyie awai rog wuii ruii shii nathek ne Hamangkhung-aphuii nane Aphuii moe shii khriig nane so um yi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:13: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">zab hà nyie ye ai re-è; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">dinne </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">zab airo hamangkhliie.</char></note><verse eid="1TH 3:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TH 4"/>
  <para style="s">Ji pha chai ne Hamangkhung-aphuii shii sang yi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 4:1"/>Idohhè, gathek khuiinothek nane bumuiithek, Hamangkhung-aphuii è sang pha nathek ne khi-è rai chid nathek ne gathek è dabjong. Hì ne, ji chak ro, nathek ne rai ramuii ro. Chiih-è thuh gathek ne dinne de muna rek bo ne Ithong Isu beng è nathek shii khung. <verse eid="1TH 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 4:2"/>Ithong Isu pha riichai è gathek è nathek shii phi pha muyuathek ne nathek ne thieg. <verse eid="1TH 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 4:3"/>Hamangkhung-aphuii ne nathek shii gang rey bo ne now ro chiih-è siulao è gang rey bo ne yang ro. <verse eid="1TH 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 4:4"/>Zab pha branthek ne awai yiy<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:4: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">nathek yiy rog shii rai bo; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">dinne </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">nawaithek siu shii phrai bo.</char></note> rog shii gang nane ilab shii khi-èrek ne rai pha ji ne thieg chid, <verse eid="1TH 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 4:5"/>Hamangkhung-aphuii shii athieg pha bran duiine siu è chid pha ji rog shii asi ro. <verse eid="1TH 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 4:6"/>Hì pha miyao è, chiihphado bran ne awai khuiinothek Masiphothek shii ichiig arek rabo dinne ai è phua ayie rabo. Gathek è hì ne igobi yaojong ro, chiih-è gathek ne chiih-è nathek shii gang phriie hanyie è hì rek pho shii ne Ithong è lago phi ruii phro. <verse eid="1TH 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 4:7"/>Hamangkhung-aphuii è gethek shii chai zea sieng pha aho ro, jishii gang rai pha ho phro. <verse eid="1TH 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 4:8"/>Ji-è chiihphado, hanyie magunde hì pha muyua shii snai pha ne bran shii snai pha asi ro, jimagunde Hamangkhung-aphuii hanyie è nathek shii Ragung So phi pha ji shii ro.<verse eid="1TH 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 4:9"/>Nathek shii ne nawaithek khuiino Masipho shii miie bo ne azey chid. Nathek nawaithek chung khi-èrek ne miie chid pha ji ne Hamangkhung-aphuii è nathek shii yuajong ro. <verse eid="1TH 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 4:10"/>Chiih-è zai nathek shii um pha ji duiine, Mesidonia pha khuiinothek nane bumuiithek shii de ziig rekramuii ro. Ji-è gathek nathek shii khung, gathek ro khuiinothek nane bumuiithek, dinne de muna rek bo. <verse eid="1TH 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 4:11"/>Nawaithek chai yi liijiing shii sieng pha phrai bo, nawai blia shii gayiig bo, chiih-è gathek è nathek shii igobi yao pha duiine, nawai sieng pha ji shii wiang bo. <verse eid="1TH 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 4:12"/>Hì pha lumuii è hanyie migipho arey ba pho è ilab mua ruii phro, chiih-è nathek nyie chiid pha ji shii ne ithek gai shii aluthong chid phro.<verse eid="1TH 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ithong wuii ruii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 4:13"/>Gathek khuiinothek nane bumuiithek, gathek ne nathek shii hanyie iy dun ji pha izai chiang shii thieg yi pha yang ro, ji-è hanyie shii luthong oi pho, nathek shii duhug arey phro. <verse eid="1TH 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 4:14"/>Gethek ne migi rek Isu ne iy ne hòi din, chiih-è gethek ne migi rek hanyie è aishii migi rek ne iy dun pho ne Hamangkhung-aphuii è Isu rog shii iidoh noh. <verse eid="1TH 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 4:15"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:15-17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 15:51-52">1Khor 15:51-52</ref> </char></note> Thuh shii gathek è nathek shii nyie yua pha ji ne Ithong ro muyua ro: gethek hanyie yi Ithong wuii ruii pha inai shii isieng um iang pho ne hanyie iyjong pho è ibi awuii. <verse eid="1TH 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 4:16"/>Thiichiih ne khohamangkhliie ro goh ne, yung srane ziak ruii phro, Hamangkhung-aphuii pha thu-ung goh, chiih-è Ithong awai hamangkhung è thazam wuii ruii phro. Chiih-è hanyie Masi shii migi rek ne iy dun pho shii igobi chai hà hòi yi phro; <verse eid="1TH 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 4:17"/>chiihphado gethek hanyie yi ji pha ishak shii isieng rai pho shii ne khrab srane hasam hà shii Ithong shii si pha ithek rog sakhmiingthek hà um ruii phro. Chiih-è gethek ne idang Ithong rog shii ruii ruii phro. <verse eid="1TH 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 4:18"/>Ji-è chiihphado hì pha miyaogamthek è nawaithek chung lububo rek bo.<verse eid="1TH 4:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TH 5"/>
  <para style="s">Ithong wuiiramuii pha ji shii saro iang bo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 5:1"/>Khuiinothek nane bumuiithek, hì pha ishak nane ithua ne khuchung rey ruii, ji ne nathek shii ne azey chid. <verse eid="1TH 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 5:2"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:43">Mth 24:43</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:39">Lug 12:39</ref>; <ref loc="2PE 3:10">2Phth 3:10</ref></char></note>Chiih-è nathek nawaithek ne bajo wie thieg mugo yi habiu wuii pha duiine Ithong pha Inai de thog ruii phro. <verse eid="1TH 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 5:3"/>Branthek yao shii, “Zab ne liijiing nane ragia ro,” chiihphado hamblo shii ithek shii ne srobro thog ruii phro! Hì ne hò-amuii è ani giak pha rek shii riie pha duiine hamblo thog ruii phro, chiih-è branthek ne ayao mua phro. <verse eid="1TH 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 5:4"/>Jimagunde, khuiinothek nane bumuiithek, nathek ne igiia hà asi ro, chiih-è Inai ne nathek shii mugo duiine anomuluii pha ayie yi phro. <verse eid="1TH 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 5:5"/>Nathek zab branthek hanyie yi ichuang pha, chiih-è hanyie yi inai pha ro. Gethek ne habiu nane igiia pha asi ro. <verse eid="1TH 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 5:6"/>Ji-è chiihphado, gethek ne ithek gai duiine men ne arai rabo; gethek ne sieng ne athiig pha rai bo. <verse eid="1TH 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 5:7"/>Branthek ne habiu hà men; chiih-è habiu hà niing phro. <verse eid="1TH 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 5:8"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 59:17">Aij 59:17</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 6:13-17">Iphy 6:13-17</ref></char></note>Jimagunde gethek ne hanai pha ro, chiih-è gethek ne athiig pha chid. Gethek ne migi shii guii ne chiih-è miie shii khug duiine, chiih-è gethek è giawo pha luthong shii khuthung duiine thung chid. <verse eid="1TH 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 5:9"/>Hamangkhung-aphuii è gethek shii airo lijieg shii diig yi pha agua ro, jimagunde gathek ro Ithong Isu Masi chiang è giawo shii mua yie pha gua ro. <verse eid="1TH 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 5:10"/>Ji-è ai wuii ruii shii gethek ne iyjong magunde chiih-è isieng magunde ai rog shii rai mua pha Isu ne gethek chiang shii iy dun. <verse eid="1TH 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 5:11"/>Ji-è thuh nathek rekramuii pha ji duiine, gethek chung lububo rek ne gethek chung nong rai bo.<verse eid="1TH 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Idohhè pha muyua nane salam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 5:12"/>Gathek nathek shii khung, gathek ro khuiinothek nane bumuiithek, hanyie è nathek duchoi shii Masi pha chai ji yua ne, gayiig rek pho shii wie è ilab phi bo. <verse eid="1TH 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 5:13"/>Nyieliieshii ithek è rek pha blia shii boh nane miie rog ilab rek bo. Nawaithek duchoi shii liijiing rai bo.<verse eid="1TH 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 5:14"/>Gathek ne nathek shii khung, gathek ro khuiinothek nane bumuiithek, siikhad-ajo pho shii phriie bo, murum dum pho shii lububo rek phi bo, zia pho shii nongphi bo, zab shii zud bo. <verse eid="1TH 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 5:15"/>Riig bo hanyie è nathek shii awie pha rek ithek shii iidoh arog rabo, Jimagunde idang pha ishak shii nathek ro phrai ne nawaithek nane zab bran shii wie rek pha phrai bo.<verse eid="1TH 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 5:16"/>Idang lubo rek bo, <verse eid="1TH 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 5:17"/>idang ishak sia bo, <verse eid="1TH 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 5:18"/>Isu Masi hà ne, Hamangkhung-aphuii ne nathek è hì chid pha ji ro, zab pha diig shii de sang shii de idang ishak shii laso phi bo.<verse eid="1TH 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 5:19"/>Ragung So shii agak rabo; <verse eid="1TH 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 5:20"/>Muathek chaig pha ji shii makhak-ariing rabo; <verse eid="1TH 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TH 5:21"/>zab pha manathek shii chai bo: nyie yi wie ji ruii bo <verse eid="1TH 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TH 5:22"/>chiih-è awie pha ji shii zab thoh muii bo.<verse eid="1TH 5:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TH 5:23"/>Hamangkhung-aphuii hanyie è gethek shii liijiing phi ne zab pha lumuii shii so rab ne na è rek pha ji shii zab ruii bo—ragung, luruak, nane siu—gethek ro Ithong Isu Masi wuii shii zab ichiig ne ichad ruii bo. <verse eid="1TH 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TH 5:24"/>Hanyie na shii ho ai ne rek phi phro, nyieliieshii ai ne isiie ro.<verse eid="1TH 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TH 5:25"/>Khuiinothek nane bumuiithek gathek shii de sia phi bo.<verse eid="1TH 5:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1TH 5:26"/>Liijiing pha khichiug è zab pha migipho shii salam rek bo.<verse eid="1TH 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1TH 5:27"/>Hì pha jigi ne zab migipho è tham bo gune Ithong pha riichai è nathek shii khung ne yao.<verse eid="1TH 5:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1TH 5:28"/>Gethek ro Ithong Isu Masi ro bushun ne nathek rog shii um bo.<verse eid="1TH 5:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 5"/>
</usx>
